      "strokeColor": "#495057",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "text": "Green = real integration running today.   Amber = labelled mock.   Blue = the human decision.\nGrey beneath each box = what a production deployment puts there instead.\nTwo Telegram bots: the renter talks to the leasing assistant, the manager gets decisions. They never share a conversation.",
